<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BetzDearborn raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BetzDearborn raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded BetzDearborn Inc to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said it kept the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- BetzDearborn closed Wednesday at 61-7/8.</p>
</text>
